1
00:00:02,090 --> 00:00:06,630
If something is not working, you can send support a diagnostic report.

2
00:00:06,730 --> 00:00:10,440
Open Settings and go to Diagnostics.

3
00:00:10,540 --> 00:00:17,610
Details shows what goes into the report, such as your settings and app logs.

4
00:00:17,710 --> 00:00:21,230
Then choose what to do with it: send it to the server, save it to a file, or e-mail it.

5
00:00:21,330 --> 00:00:27,850
Click Start.

6
00:00:27,950 --> 00:00:34,470
The report is ready. Send this file to your broker's support team.

